V=../avatar/refs; H=/home/user/marketingskills/docs/content-video/assets/hosts
SET="Setting: a glass-walled meeting room on a high floor in soft daylight. Behind the floor-to-ceiling glass: a bright pearl-white overcast sky fills the upper part of the view, and low near the horizon there is a soft hazy panorama of a modern coastal city. A long dark walnut table with compact broadcast microphones on low desk stands (no logos), a closed laptop, a notebook, a glass of water."
ST="Photorealistic photograph, not an illustration, full-frame camera, 35mm lens, shallow depth of field, natural skin texture, clean airy daylight colour grade. Vertical 9:16 frame. No readable text, no logos, no watermark."
VIT="the man from the reference photos: keep his identity exactly, same shaved bald head, same face shape, dark eyebrows and eyes, short dark stubble, same age and build; he wears the same black thick-rimmed acetate glasses as in the close-up reference and the outfit from his full-length reference: black fine-knit turtleneck under a charcoal-grey unstructured blazer"
G="the blonde woman from the reference photos: keep her identity exactly, same face, long straight light honey-blonde hair worn loose, outfit from her full-length reference: white tailored trouser suit with an ivory silk camisole, thin gold chain"
CUT="The table top runs across the bottom of the frame and the frame ends at the table: nothing below the table top is visible, no legs, no feet, no chair bases, no empty chairs anywhere."
g(){ /usr/bin/python3 gen.py "$@"; }
g o_vit_b2 "$SET $ST One person in the frame, the same room as in the room reference photo. This is $VIT. He sits at the table turned three-quarters to the left, looks into the camera lens, lips slightly parted mid-sentence, one hand raised slightly in an explaining gesture. Medium shot from the waist up. $CUT Composition: the whole upper 40 percent of the frame is empty bright sky behind the glass; the top of his head is below that line." $V/office_solo.jpg v3.jpg vit_glasses_crop.jpg o_vit_a.png &
g o_two2 "$SET $ST Two people in a relaxed interview, the same room as in the room reference photo. They sit well apart at the same side of the long table with a clear gap of about one metre of empty table and bright window between them: she is in the left third of the frame, he is in the right third, their shoulders are far from touching. Each has a microphone. Both are angled slightly toward each other and toward the camera. On the left: $G; she listens with a light smile, hands on the table. On the right: $VIT; he speaks calmly with one hand open on the table. Both are seen from the waist up behind the table. $CUT Composition: the whole upper 40 percent of the frame is empty bright sky behind the glass; both heads are below that line." $H/host_G_face.jpg g2.jpg $V/office_solo.jpg v3.jpg vit_glasses_crop.jpg o_vit_a.png &
